# Messages a phone app sends through the node show up on the device, as ours:
# pending, then delivered on the ACK; the phone's retry is not a second message; an
# unanswered one fails; a channel send appears.
node Erin 6
as Erin advert
wait 3000
phone on
key menu
key down 3
key enter
wait 2000
hold esc 900
key right
key enter
wait 500
phone dm Erin Sent from the phone
wait 500
expect window 1
expect last Sent from the phone
wait 4000
expect status delivered
shot phone-dm-delivered
# The phone sends it again (a retry of the same message): still one.
phone retry
wait 3000
expect window 1
# A new message the contact cannot ACK: pending, then failed once the wait is over.
unlink Cardputer Erin
phone dm Erin Anyone there?
wait 500
expect window 2
expect status pending
wait 30000
expect status failed
shot phone-dm-failed
